universal-wasm-loader-c provides a single header and the wasmtime C API.

In exactly one translation unit, define UWL_IMPLEMENTATION before including:

    #define UWL_IMPLEMENTATION
    #include <universal_wasm_loader.h>

From CMake:

    find_package(universal-wasm-loader-c CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::universal-wasm-loader-c)

The target carries the include directory, the wasmtime library, and the
platform system libraries; no further linkage is required.
